While active, casting a melee ability that deals damage will cause a Sweeping Strike, dealing 40% weapon damage to 5 nearby enemies, further increased by attack power. Lasts 10 sec. 

@ext:Can't be active at the same time as Blade Flurry.

This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Increases your melee attack speed by 20%. In addition, attacks strike an additional nearby opponent. Lasts 20 sec.

@ext:Can't be active at the same time as Sweeping Strikes.
 
This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Hurls a book at your target, dealing -96 Physical damage, interrupting their casting and preventing any spell from that school of magic from being cast for 6 sec.

@ext:This ability shares a cooldown with other interrupts.:ext@

@ext:Scales with Counterspell modifiers.:ext@

Deals 100% Weapon damage up to 5 enemies in front of you. 

Becoming Enraged enables one use of Raging Lunge. You can store up to 2 charges.

@ext:This uses Raging Blow modifiers.:ext@
